Specification Starting
Description This is a starting spectable file for users trying it out

Calculation Temperature Conversion

Description Convert F to C 
Examples: FandC
| F   | C   | Notes      |
| 32  | 0   | Freezing   |
| 212 | 100 | Boiling    |
| -40 | -40 | Below zero |

Attributes  FandC
Description Input and Output
| Name  | Default | DataType | Notes |
| F     | 0       | Integer  |       |
| C     | 0       | Integer  |       |
| Notes |         | String   |       |
